Host checks for the actual legacy FORTIFY wrappers
=================================================
TEST_OUTPUT=/absolute/output TEST_CLANG=/path/to/clang python3 tools/testing/selftests/fortify_clang/run-host.py

Requires native Clang13+ and GCC. Extracts the actual string.h wrappers and
checks valid operations, compile-time source/destination overflow rejection and
a dynamic memset overflow trap in a subprocess. No kernel panic is induced.
This tests a native host fixture with libc aliases and simplified kernel macros;
full target compilation and normal hardware operation still require validation.
